Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.89,0:00:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}關東煮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:07.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,完了... 這次完蛋了...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:10.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這次再搞砸了 我就要...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:10.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(895,970)}{\fs50}績效再不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:14.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:19.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,光靠亂暴獸 是打不過Precure的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:22.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只能用最後那套了...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:23.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:24.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,先幫奶奶跑完腿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:31.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就去唯美的咖啡館喝茶吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:31.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(835,975)}Pretty Holic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:34.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,棒！那裡的甜點太絕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:36.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:40.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,臭丫頭們...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.05,0:00:43.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:45.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呸！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.74,0:00:46.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是你...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:47.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:51.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,火大起來了 看到你們就惱火！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:56.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我這邊是沒退路了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.17,0:01:01.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,退路？你什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:05.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴！這都怪你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:06.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:09.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,在我抓住天空公主的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:11.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你不來礙事！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.33,0:01:15.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,從那天開始 我想做的事該做的事 就沒一件干成的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.61,0:01:18.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是我的瘟神！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:21.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只要打倒你 就能事事順心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:24.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,和我一對一單挑吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:28.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,時間定在三天後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:32.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我會用強中強的殺手鐧 打倒你！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.35,0:01:35.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不識好歹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:38.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 沒有必要接受這種決鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:40.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,容不得你拒絕！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:46.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣吧 要是你贏了 我從此不再對天空公主出手！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.23,0:01:50.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你這話當真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.31,0:01:52.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,當真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:55.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,反正要是輸了 我也會被處理掉的...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:02:00.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這次是最終決戰了！給我洗乾淨脖子等著吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}強耶欸！Cure Sky對卡疤痛!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50\pos(955,970)}天空愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:47.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 真的可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續僵持下去 就算把小空送回藍天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1400,955)}{\fs50}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:57.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛也會盯著她的 我無法放心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:03:59.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這次要解決問題
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:01.62,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:05.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 能夠相信那種人的話嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:09.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛的眼神突然變得認真起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:13.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼他說的殺手鐧 應該也不是虛張聲勢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,他究竟會用什麼手段...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:17.39,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:23.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道他會用什麼手段 最後會贏的...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:25.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是英雄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:27.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.15,0:04:31.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 我也是很擔心的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.77,0:04:34.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,既然已經決定了 就為小晴加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:38.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,距離決戰還有3天 我有一個想法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特訓 特訓 快樂特訓
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:48.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,突然拜託你 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:51.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶在準備打開去藍天大地的通道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.80,0:04:53.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,正好要到緊要關頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.99,0:05:01.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶現在也忙著趕幼師學校的報告吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.59,0:05:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 我可是超優秀的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且也是為了小晴的大決戰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.92,0:05:10.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.59,0:05:11.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還能見到少年呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 行李太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不保持這個形態 就坐不下了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:24.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,無所謂... 這才是我原本的形態
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:26.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼要特訓點什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傳統的瀑布下冥想？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與山王戰鬥？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！難道是那種在山頂上修煉必殺技
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:45.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 你是漫畫看多了吧 怎麼可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.27,0:05:47.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,對！就是這種特訓！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.61,0:05:48.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:49.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！就是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好！我知道一個不錯的瀑布
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去看看！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:56.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:56.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:56.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:57.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:03.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:03.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:03.22,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？是我調查出來的超棒充能地點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:10.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 在這裡就能盡情特訓了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:14.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！我馬上就進瀑布...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:20.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,他是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:22.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對是高手...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:24.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,非要用語言形容 就是進入了無的境界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:28.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,毫無雜念 與自然融合
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肩膀！不酸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:35.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:35.69,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡了個好覺 哈 舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 仔細看了一下內容 這裡是治療肩膀酸痛的充能地點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:48.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:48.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:51.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 你要看看清楚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:56.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才還說自己“超優秀”的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:07:00.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是學校太忙了 就沒什麼空閒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.26,0:07:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:02.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:03.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈... 沒有 沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別問了 接著該去找山王了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我查一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:15.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真拿你沒辦法 我去找附近的鳥打聽一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:16.76,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 你還會鳥語的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:25.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那是 我也是鳥嘛 這裡就交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:26.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:26.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:30.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就趁這段時間 去做野營的準備
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:32.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,晚餐敬請期待
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:33.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:37.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那我去沖一下瀑布 凝聚精神！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:39.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 我就...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:42.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,去趕學校的報告！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:43.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈... 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\fs50}天窗營地 致光臨營地的遊客們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:08.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是山王？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:10.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:10.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.59,0:08:13.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在那邊的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:19.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an1}喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:19.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:43.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:44.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.77,0:08:46.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就在明天了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:47.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:50.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 不知怎麼的 睡不著了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:52.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 我也是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:54.79,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:56.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:09:00.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛究竟會用什麼殺手鐧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:04.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我東想西想的 睡意全無了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.49,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,連我們都沒辦法冷靜下來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗就更緊張了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:11.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:14.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也就能做到這種程度的出謀劃策
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:17.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們會盡全力為你加油的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:18.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:20.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不只有我們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:25.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,還有蝶華姐 由由阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.43,0:09:27.62,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:30.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主好像也在為你加油
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:32.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是我堅強的後盾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:37.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝大家 我一掃心裡的陰霾！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:54.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你來了... 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:03.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.51,0:10:07.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我以為你慫得逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:09.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我遵守了約定
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:13.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛 你還記得你答應的事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:17.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我要是輸了 就不對公主出手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:21.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呵 我怎麼可能輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:27.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是我的殺手鐧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.89,0:10:32.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這是花費了3天 提高至最極限的暗塌谷能量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,將其注入自己體內！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:43.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！極限暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.97,0:10:50.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,強耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:08.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,能量充盈！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:11.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是我的殺手鐧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:15.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,強中... 強！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:21.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,居然將自己變為類似亂暴獸的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.19,0:11:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是非常危險啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:26.53,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:30.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:31.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:38.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:38.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:42.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:42.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:48.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:51.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:51.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.35,0:12:00.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.35,0:12:00.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:08.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:08.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:16.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:16.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,廣闊無限的藍天！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:42.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:42.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:54.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我很強！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:00.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好... 好強的力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:07.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,看招！看招！看招！看招！看招！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:14.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？是不是強中強啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:18.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你只要吃到一擊 就完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:22.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精神！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:27.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,現在！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.15,0:13:29.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:42.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:46.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那是山王傳授的...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:49.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,特訓出成果了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:51.70,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:55.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,大... 大意了...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:59.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我是強中... 強的...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:00.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:04.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能輸給你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:07.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.43,0:14:08.56,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:12.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,如何？這下你沒辦法到處亂竄了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣捏爆你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:18.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不掙脫出來的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.18,0:14:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.18,0:14:23.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.18,0:14:23.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:28.44,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.11,0:14:34.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道跟著你過來了 省的我去找了...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:48.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎... 怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:50.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量應該是我壓倒性的強啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:52.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:55.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能會這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:57.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙的...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:15:03.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙的加油 給予我力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.64,0:15:07.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,加... 加油 這種東西...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:12.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,與強不強無關！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:20.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:28.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:28.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:31.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:38.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡... 卡疤...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:45.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,贏... 贏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是贏了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.85,0:15:48.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太厲害了 Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.11,0:15:50.61,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:57.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 輸了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:14.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛 按照約定 你別再找小空的...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:18.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這種約定 我早就忘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:21.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不管使用什麼手段
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:25.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,最終獲得勝利的才是強者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.65,0:16:32.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只要抓到公主 就是我贏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:34.31,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:35.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真白！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:36.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
