Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:04.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗了
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.28,0:19:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.36,0:19:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什... 什... 什... 什... 什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:18.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛 是你輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不要！我不能輸的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.03,0:19:30.14,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在暗塌谷帝國 弱者是沒有價值的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才拚了命的要變成強者...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:39.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.12,0:19:41.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,帝國？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！住...住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還能派上用場的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還請... 還請繞過我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:01.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,難道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:06.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:07.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛 我來救你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是你的敵人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.81,0:20:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為... 為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.41,0:20:19.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:25.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是認為 這樣做才是正義！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這才是... 真正的強大...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我輸了... 你很強
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遠比我要強
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:20:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再會了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啊 下面是河啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:17.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛說過的暗塌谷帝國 究竟是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:20.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好像連奶奶都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:23.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,最直接的方法 是去問卡疤痛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.89,0:21:26.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,應該再也見不到他了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.71,0:21:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先是被裁掉了 還掉到河裡 真是難為你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.59,0:21:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爹...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會回首過去的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.61,0:21:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要在這座城市 重新起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:48.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 阿翼 還有很多事情不能放心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.21,0:21:51.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這種時候 我們必須要打起精神來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:55.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我們換換心情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.22,0:22:01.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不管再來什麼對手 都只管保護好小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.30,0:22:03.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.30,0:22:03.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:09.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Whip哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:09.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1025,970)}奶油愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:13.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們一起攪拌攪拌！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.35,0:23:47.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空在走路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.20,0:23:49.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,紀念公主第一次走路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:51.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去買鞋子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.81,0:23:53.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這雙鞋子怎麼樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.20,0:23:54.03,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.19,0:23:54.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這雙呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.06,0:23:55.65,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:57.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這是最後一雙了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.62,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次！送給你的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:05.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.47,0:02:11.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:16.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:24.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:29.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:33.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:35.21,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:39.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.09,0:02:44.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:46.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:50.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:54.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:57.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:57.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:03:00.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:00.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:05.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:10.41,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:15.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:20.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:23.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:31.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.99,0:22:29.66,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.66,0:22:34.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:37.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:38.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.81,0:22:41.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.65,0:22:44.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.11,0:22:46.07,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:48.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:51.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.53,0:22:53.20,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.33,0:22:55.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.01,0:23:02.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:08.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:10.60,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.31,0:23:14.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:19.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.24,0:23:25.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.41,0:23:29.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:33.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.75,0:23:37.45,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.45,0:23:38.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.84,0:23:41.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
